{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"accusations\": [\n    {\n      \"paper\": \"Zhang等，2025年，PMID:41131028（PMC-STN与M1-STN alpha coherence、冻结转弯及冻结持续时间研究）\",\n      \"pmid\": \"41131028\",\n      \"doi\": \"\",\n      \"report_says\": \"报告称该研究提示皮层-STN alpha活动具有区域及阶段依赖性，但相关连接变化不一定能够预测冻结持续时间；在证据提取中仅记录了M1-STN alpha coherence预测价值不显著的结果。此外，报告第3.3节及H4、H5将PMC-STN alpha耦合增强主要作为保护性代偿或病理性过度同步两种竞争性解释，未充分区分不同冻结阶段的作用。\",\n      \"judge_says\": \"原文明确报告，PMC-STN alpha coherence在正常转弯前准备阶段（TurnPre）升高，而且TurnPre阶段PMC-STN alpha coherence增加能够显著预测较短的冻结持续时间（β=0.205，P=0.006）。冻结转弯起始阶段（TurnStart）PMC-STN alpha coherence也出现升高。没有显著预测价值的是M1 alpha功率和M1-STN alpha coherence，而不是PMC-STN alpha coherence。报告将M1-STN连接的阴性预测结果错误地推广到整个皮层-STN连接，遗漏了PMC-STN连接的显著正向预测结果；同时忽视了TurnPre阶段可能具有保护性关联、TurnStart阶段可能表现为另一种网络状态的阶段特异性，因而将不同阶段的耦合功能过度简化为代偿与病理的全局二选一。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f245ef28-e584-4c79-a274-ff1df6c7d87d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T115612259771Z", "elapsed_seconds": 28.531, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T11:56:40.798522+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5b4208f954eacacaf84931c32b42725fb69c0b8df8605c7a4fca95501080cc6b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docke